    "Two original512px imported surfaces: irregular red-brown masonry and one transparent maple-sprig cluster; shared immutable Resources with mipmapped high-quality compression and foliage alpha coverage.",
    "Five broad asymmetric crown limbs per tree,320 shallow folded sprig cards per tree; mathematical deterministic variation without consuming the city height Random sequence.",
    "Foreground brick terraces and mansard fronts, offices retained on side streets; original building/road positions, heights and all54BoxCollider authorities unchanged.",
    "Finer asphalt repetition, restrained warmer daylight/ambient/fog and amber route chevrons. World sun excludes isolated layer30 service studio; existing cached photos keep their own local lighting.",
    "Masonry normal relief derives from the actual texture color/mortar edge, avoiding an incorrect second4x8grid. The selected generated tile has nine irregular courses, not the eight requested in the generation prompt."
